# s7_embed_chunk: one-hot embedding matmul in 16 vocabulary slices. Phase B, paid.
#
# position   only paid lever on this line (+2.6% wall on the undecomposed program; the two preceding
#            steps +0.9% vs 4.9% spread, free): last by rule 6.
# object     owner census: 950.2 of a 961.5 MB grouped row (98.8%) embedding-shaped ((28996, 768) shares,
#            (1, 128, 28996) one-hot intermediates, flat 28996 x 768). Triple and PRZS masks 1/16 at a time.
# phase B    (a) +30 rounds on the same bytes (whole-model program 1495 -> 1525; SHAFT-GPU 1496 -> 1526);
#            (b) impl/equiv_embed_chunk.py.
# expected   ~-10% (as on the whole-model line).
SHAFT_SCRIPT=$BASE/bert_perlayer_stream_cpu.py
SHAFT_LEVERS=plaintext_free_cpu,triple_share_free_cpu,trace_nograd_cpu,onnx_single_file_export_cpu,encrypt_spill_cpu,embed_chunk_cpu
SHAFT_INNER_ENV="SHAFT_EMBED_CHUNKS=16"
